      ],
      "text": "Make the top of your screen useful. One installer, no setup screen. It’s running in about a minute, and by the second time you nudge the top edge you won’t remember doing it on purpose. Download v0.7.0 Build from source Windows 10 & 11, 64-bit Served straight from GitHub Starts with Windows MIT licensed Windows SmartScreen may warn on first run: the installer is not yet code-signed by a paid certificate. Choose More info → Run anyway, or build it yourself from the repo.",
