    {
      "selector": "#community",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7733,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1012,
      "heading": "Built in the open, with the people using it.",
      "backgroundColor": "#050508",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Join the Discord",
        "DiscordBug reports, changelogs and whatever gets built next.",
        "GitHubThe whole source, every release, and the issue tracker"
      ],
      "text": "Community Built in the open, with the people using it. There is no support portal and no ticket queue. There is a Discord server where the person who writes the app reads what you post, and a public issue tracker for anything that outlives a conversation. Crest: Windows Dynamic Notch Fully open source, and free. Bug reports, changelogs, feature requests, and early looks at panels that are not out yet. Report a bug and watch it get fixed See what is being built before it ships Ask for a panel you want Say when something feels wrong Join the Discord Free, no account beyond Discord’s own. Discord",
      "layout": "split",
      "assetUrls": [
        "http://localhost:3000/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcrest-logo.097ke1ulh2ahw.png&w=96&q=75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": "#faq",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8744,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1063,
      "heading": "Before you install.",
      "backgroundColor": "#050508",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Discord",
        "open an issue"
      ],
      "text": "Questions Before you install. Still unsure about something? Ask in the Discord or open an issue , both get answered. Does this need a laptop with a physical notch? Will it get in the way of my windows? Which music apps work? How do notifications in the notch work? I have two monitors. Which one does it live on? Can I change how it looks? How does it update? Can I stop Windows showing its own pop-ups too? Can I move it, or keep it on screen? Where do I report a bug or ask for something? Does it phone home? Is it heavy? How do I get rid of it? Is it really free?",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
